WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.498
Last Saturday, I went to an amusement park with my brother. What a day!

2
00:00:07.948 --> 00:00:12.499
First, the roller coaster. It was so exciting!

3
00:00:12.949 --> 00:00:14.946
I was very excited.

4
00:00:17.196 --> 00:00:21.608
Then we went into the haunted house. It was very scary…

5
00:00:22.058 --> 00:00:25.123
…and my brother was really scared!

6
00:00:27.373 --> 00:00:32.388
We waited in a line for one hour. It was so boring!

7
00:00:32.838 --> 00:00:34.092
I was bored.

8
00:00:36.342 --> 00:00:39.686
At the end of the day, I was very tired.

9
00:00:40.136 --> 00:00:42.086
It was a tiring day!

10
00:00:44.336 --> 00:00:50.141
But it was a fantastic day. And you? What's an exciting place for you?

